		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=3540&amp;p=27836#p27836"><![CDATA[
Hi all, This is my version of <a href="https://NEDECN.org" class="postlink">NEDECN.org</a> network codeplug. This code plug is based on the information on NEDECN.org website "31 August 2023 Updated on DMR Repeaters" and assuming all repeaters obey the <a href="https://nedecn.org/talk-groups/talk-group-pyramid/" class="postlink">"Talk Group Pyramid"</a><br><br>State wide talk groups are special.<br>For example, On all MA repeaters TG "3125 MA" will be on Timeslot 2 while on any other states repeaters this talkgroup will be on TS 1.<br>To address this, this codeplug will display -MA- for talkgroup on MA Repeaters, -CT- on CT and NY repeaters, etc.<br>Thank you SA0BUX for the idea.<br><br><strong class="text-strong">*** DO NOT FORGET TO CHANGE YOUR CALL SIGN AND DMR ID ***</strong><div class="inline-attachment"><dl class="file"><dt><span class="imageset icon_topic_attach"></span> <a class="postlink" href="http://localhost/opengd77/download/file.php?id=2028&amp;sid=9fddac933db93c473f5d87819eb317fc">NEDECN.g77</a></dt></dl></div><br>I'm very open for suggestion, opinions, error spotting, etc.<br>Hope this to be useful.<br>KA1CM<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=5068">KA1CM</a> — Sun Dec 03, 2023 2:55 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
